                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A taxiarch has a hand weapon, light armour and large shield. A hipparch rides a horse (+9), or a Warhorse (+16); becoming Used to Elephants and has heavy armour and xyston (+2), or light armour, javelins and shield (+1).</characteristic>
