              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All cavalry are Used to Elephants. Companions and Line cavalry have hand weapon, light armour and xyston and may upgrade to heavy armour (+1). Wedge. They may exchange xyston for throwing spear and shield (free), in which case they lose the Wedge rule.</characteristic>
